                </span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <svg
                    class="w-5 h-5 text-green-400"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                  >
                    <path
                      fill-rule="evenodd"
