              Influencer Recruiting und visuelles Employer Branding.
            </p>
            <ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-2 mb-6">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-pink-500 rounded-full"></span>
                Story Ads
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-pink-500 rounded-full"></span>
